{"symbol":"INDOBELL","yahoo":"INDOBELL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Indobell Insulation Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","website":"https://www.indobell.com","about":"Indobell Insulation Limited operates as a manufacturer and contractor of insulation products and prefabricated thermal insulation jackets in India. The company offers ceramic and mineral fibre nodules, granulated rockwool, spray insulation, LRB mattress insulation, ceramic fiber blanket insulation, heat shield, and fibreglass aerogel insulation. It also trades in LRB mattresses, ceramic fiber blankets, aluminum sheets, and prefabricated thermal insulation jackets. In addition, the company provides consultancy, engineering, fabrication and prefabrication, material supply, installation, global logistics, project management, research and development, application of insulation work, and insulation supervision services. Its products are used to insulate various applications, including industrial plants and other related insulation materials. The company exports its products to Bangladesh, Germany, Taiwan, Poland, South Korea, and the United States of America. Indobell Insulation Limited was incorporated in 1972 and is based in Kolkata, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:30:07+00:00","quote":{"price":63.1,"prevClose":66.21,"marketCap":39.75,"high52":107.0,"low52":44.75,"pe":49.3,"bookValue":25.9,"dividendRate":2.0,"roe":5.08,"shares":0.63,"insiders":76.33,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-01-13","2025-01-14","2025-01-15","2025-01-16","2025-01-17","2025-01-20","2025-01-21","2025-01-22","2025-01-23","2025-01-24","2025-01-27","2025-01-28","2025-01-29","2025-01-30","2025-01-31","2025-02-03","2025-02-04","2025-02-05","2025-02-06","2025-02-07","2025-02-10","2025-02-11","2025-02-12","2025-02-13","2025-02-14","2025-02-17","2025-02-18","2025-02-19","2025-02-20","2025-02-21","2025-02-24","2025-02-25","2025-02-27","2025-02-28","2025-03-03","2025-03-04","2025-03-05","20